---
// Attachments tab — R2 list of every object in the bucket.
---
<div class="panel" id="tab-attachments" hidden>
  <h2>Attachments <span class="tag">R2 · env.UPLOADS</span></h2>
  <p class="what">
    Every object in the bucket (<code>list</code>). Files come from the Notes tab;
    each download link is a <code>get</code> carrying the object's sha256
    <code>httpEtag</code>.
  </p>
  <div class="row"><button class="ghost" id="refresh-att">Refresh</button></div>
  <table id="att-table">
    <thead><tr><th>key</th><th>size</th><th>uploaded</th><th></th></tr></thead>
    <tbody></tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="rawapi"><code><a href="/attachments">GET /attachments</a></code></p>
</div>
